(TACOMA?S NEW GRAND OPERA HOUSE.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Tacoma has hitherto lacked one most essential feature of a city--an) Tj T*
(opera house--and for this reason has been often denied the pleasure) Tj T*
(of listening to some of the great dramatic stars who have visited) Tj T*
(the coast. It will not be long before this will be remedied, as the) Tj T*
(most elegant opera house north of San Francisco is now in course) Tj T*
(of erection. Several of the public spirited citizens of this place) Tj T*
(recently organized the Tacoma Opera House Company, with a capital stock) Tj T*
(of $100,000.00, for the purpose of building an opera house such as the) Tj T*
(growing needs of the city require. Plans were drawn for an elegant) Tj T*
(building to cost $75,000.00, and this is now in course of construction) Tj T*
(on the corner of Ninth and C streets. The first story is of stone and) Tj T*
(the remainder of brick and terra cotta. It will have accommodations) Tj T*
(for several stores on the ground floor, and for a number of offices) Tj T*
