(HOTELS OF THE TERMINAL CITY.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Tourists unhesitatingly declare that in this city they find the only) Tj T*
(really adequate and enjoyable hotel accommodations to be had on the) Tj T*
(Pacific coast north of San Francisco, and to this one fact is due much) Tj T*
(of the popularity of the city spread abroad by those who have enjoyed) Tj T*
(its hospitalities. Recognizing the necessity for such an institution,) Tj T*
(the Tacoma Land Company erected in 1884 the large and handsome stone) Tj T*
(and brick hotel building shown in the engraving on the opposite page.) Tj T*
(It stands on the bluff above the water front, overlooking the bay,) Tj T*
(river, valley, foothills and mountains. From the veranda and lawn a) Tj T*
(grand landscape may be seen, the great snowy mass of Mount Tacoma) Tj T*
(standing out in bold relief against the sky. The possession of such) Tj T*
(a house of entertainment, elegantly furnished and conducted in first) Tj T*
(class style by Mr. W. D. Tyler, a most courteous and able manager,) Tj T*
(renders the city a favorite summer resort and headquarters for those) Tj T*
(who desire to spend a few weeks viewing the grand scenery of the) Tj T*
(sound. On another page is given an engraving of the new and elegant) Tj T*
(Hotel Fife, a large five-story brick structure, recently completed) Tj T*
(at a cost of $125,000.00. It contains one hundred and twenty-six) Tj T*
(rooms, and is supplied with all the modern conveniences of gas, water,) Tj T*
(electric bells, elevator, etc. Hotel Fife is most elegantly furnished,) Tj T*
(and is conducted on the European plan. Hotel Rochester, recently) Tj T*
(erected on Tacoma avenue \(see engraving on another page\), is a large) Tj T*
(brick edifice, four stories high, and cost $75,000.00. It occupies a) Tj T*
(commanding site, and is designed for a family hotel, all its rooms) Tj T*
(being _en suite_, with bath, electric light and water. It is heated) Tj T*
(by steam, and has its own electric light plant, laundry and Turkish) Tj T*
(bath. A number of smaller hotels add to the city?s accommodations for) Tj T*
