(LUMBER INTERESTS OF TACOMA.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Lumber is one of the chief products of Puget sound, and in the) Tj T*
(lumbering industry Tacoma leads all other cities on the sound, or on) Tj T*
(the Pacific coast. Mill capacity has more than doubled the present) Tj T*
(season. In January four mills were cutting four hundred thousand feet) Tj T*
(per day; since then five new mills have been built and two of the old) Tj T*
(ones have increased their capacity, one of them, the Tacoma Mill Co.,) Tj T*
(to five hundred thousand feet, making now a total output of eight) Tj T*
(hundred and thirty-five thousand feet. This will be greatly increased) Tj T*
