(world, with a capacity of three hundred thousand feet a day. The larger) Tj T*
(mills are all supplied with shingle and lath machines, and millions) Tj T*
(of lath and cedar shingles are made daily. The output of shingles has) Tj T*
(quadrupled within the past year. Sash and door factories have increased) Tj T*
