(STREETS, WATER WORKS AND ELECTRIC LIGHTS.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Electricity lights the business thoroughfares and many of the stores,) Tj T*
(while gas illuminates other portions of the city. The gas works were) Tj T*
(built in 1884, and the electric light plant, now having twenty miles of) Tj T*
(wire, was put in by a responsible company in 1887. There is, also, an) Tj T*
(excellent telephone service, with an extended circuit reaching Puyallup) Tj T*
(valley. In its water works it is especially fortunate. The system was) Tj T*
