() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Whenever so young a city as Tacoma is mentioned it is generally) Tj T*
(spoken of as a prospective metropolis, whose present growth is based) Tj T*
(largely upon the future. Great as Tacoma?s future is sure to be, its) Tj T*
(present condition has not been reached by discounting it nor is its) Tj T*
(great prosperity due to large drafts on future industries. It has now) Tj T*
(many establishments which employ a large number of hands, pay many) Tj T*
(thousands of dollars to workmen monthly, and turn out a manufactured) Tj T*
(product valued at millions of dollars annually. One of these branches) Tj T*
(of industry is the saw mills and sash factories spoken of elsewhere, in) Tj T*
(which Tacoma is one of the leading cities of the world. Besides this) Tj T*
(there are a furniture factory, iron foundry, machine shops, flouring) Tj T*
(mills, car shops, and a number of smaller industries. The car shops) Tj T*
(of the Northern Pacific are located here, and give employment to a) Tj T*
(large number of hands. The huge reduction works being erected here,) Tj T*
(the flouring mills, and the gigantic iron smelting enterprise at Cle) Tj T*
(Elum, have been mentioned on other pages. The only coking ovens on the) Tj T*
(coast are located near the city and are owned by Tacoma parties. These) Tj T*
(enterprises are enough to account for the prosperous condition of the) Tj T*
(city, yet they are but an index of the manufacturing which will be done) Tj T*
(here in a few years. Situated in the midst of coal, iron, limestone,) Tj T*
(and hard and soft wood timber, all of unlimited quantity and superior) Tj T*
(quality; occupying the position of actual and operating terminus of a) Tj T*
(great transcontinental railroad, which renders tributary to it a vast) Tj T*
(empire producing cereals, stock, fruit, hops and other agricultural) Tj T*
(products in abundance, and is the outlet for a dozen of the richest) Tj T*
(mining districts in the west; and being already the largest shipping) Tj T*
