(made that property values would take a tumble, and that the ?boom?) Tj T*
(would collapse. Even in the ?hard times? of 1884-5 these predictions) Tj T*
(were not realized. Values were fully sustained, and as soon as the) Tj T*
(nation began to recover from its financial depression, Tacoma real) Tj T*
(estate again started upward, and is still steadily advancing. The lot) Tj T*
(that was ?too high? at $50 in 1883, and again declared ?too high? at) Tj T*
($200 in 1886, is now worth $500. The same opportunities exist to-day) Tj T*
