(COMMERCIAL ADVANTAGES OF TACOMA.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Many advantages are possessed by Tacoma which can not fail to result) Tj T*
(in building up here a large commercial city. A very large wholesale) Tj T*
(business is already established in many important lines of trade,) Tj T*
(and some of the largest and most complete retail stores to be found) Tj T*
(on the Pacific coast are located here. As an index of the condition) Tj T*
(of trade here the banking statistics are valuable. There are four) Tj T*
(national banks, one large private bank and a savings bank. The combined) Tj T*
(capital stock of these institutions is $630,000. The four national) Tj T*
(banks have $1,930,000 deposits, $1,892,000 discounts and $120,000) Tj T*
(surplus and undivided profits. Such a showing of banking business) Tj T*
(indicates a volume of trade of large proportions, and as deposits) Tj T*
(have nearly doubled during the past year, the growth of trade is) Tj T*
(certainly remarkable. Tacoma?s position as the terminus of a great) Tj T*
(overland railway, as well as the terminal port on Puget sound for all) Tj T*
