(GREEN RIVER HOT SPRINGS.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
() Tj T*
(One of the favorite summer resorts of the northwest is situated on) Tj T*
(the line of the Northern Pacific, sixty-one miles east of Tacoma,) Tj T*
(in the Cascade mountains. This is the celebrated Green River Hot) Tj T*
(Springs, five in number, with a temperature varying from 118∞ to 122∞) Tj T*
(Fahrenheit, which were discovered four years ago. A comfortable hotel,) Tj T*
(with accommodations for a large number of people, and ten cottages) Tj T*
(have already been erected. Green river is the most beautiful mountain) Tj T*
(stream in the west, and teems with trout and salmon. It derives its) Tj T*
(name from the green hue of its clear, transparent waters, brilliant) Tj T*
(in the sunlight and dark green in the shade. The mountains are full) Tj T*
(of deer, bear, mountain sheep, grouse and other game. No shooting is) Tj T*
(permitted within two hundred and fifty yards of the hotel, but the) Tj T*
(hunter and angler has not far to go to find employment for his rod) Tj T*
(and gun. Tourists will find this place the most delightful for a few) Tj T*
(days? rest in the whole extent of their journey through the west. This) Tj T*
(has been recognized by hundreds, who have availed themselves of the) Tj T*
(opportunity to enjoy the pleasure and sport here afforded. Invalids,) Tj T*
(especially, find in the medicinal qualities of the water, the pure,) Tj T*
(bracing atmosphere of the mountains, the wholesome food, and the sense) Tj T*
(of rest and freedom from care, just the conditions necessary for their) Tj T*
(restoration to health. The waters are a specific for rheumatism,) Tj T*
(catarrh, kidney troubles, skin and blood diseases, etc., and their) Tj T*
(virtue is attested by hundreds who have been benefited by them. A post) Tj T*
(office and telegraph station have been established at the hotel, and) Tj T*
(the sojourner there need not feel that he is completely isolated from) Tj T*
(the world, while daily trains pass the hotel to carry him away in case) Tj T*
(of urgent need. Persons desirous of securing accommodations in advance) Tj T*
(of arrival should address, by mail or telegraph, I. G. McCain & Co.,) Tj T*
(Hot Springs, W. T.) Tj T*
